@startuml
title stm — Autonomous bench series (A1–A6)
[*] --> Countdown
Countdown --> Emitting : after 10000 ms / start controller, first attempt due
Countdown --> Finished : stop / cancel series
Emitting --> Finished : 10 TX_SUCCESS / cleanup succeeds
Emitting --> Finished : stop / cleanup succeeds
Emitting --> Fault : initialization, submission, transmission, timeout or cleanup failure
Fault --> Fault : stop / cleanup fails or bus-off latched
Fault --> Finished : stop / cleanup succeeds and no bus-off latch
note right of Countdown
Power-up/reset arms exactly one series.
No USB host is required.
end note
note right of Emitting
At most 10 single-shot attempts, 1 Hz.
Wait for the final completion before stopping.
USB connection changes do not affect this series.
end note
note right of Finished
No restart via USB or start command.
Only MCU reset/power cycle re-arms.
Never connect to a charger.
end note
@enduml
